OL,3,GNEWSAPolice inspector denies child sex
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior police officer will stand
OL,7,Ftrial after denying three child sex
OL,8,Foffences.
OL,10,FInsp Scott Raghib, 45, who works for
OL,11,FBedfordshire Police, entered not guilty
OL,12,Fpleas at a hearing in Northampton Crown
OL,13,FCourt.
OL,15,FRaghib, of Elm Way, Hackleton,
OL,16,FNorthampton, denied two charges of
OL,17,Fengaging in sexual activity with a boy
OL,18,Fand one of engaging in sexual activity
OL,19,Fin the presence of the boy.
OL,21,FA judge said a trial would be listed to
OL,22,Fbegin on 7 February 2028.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
